{"w":"discord","p":"n.","m":"Disagreement; lack of harmony.","e":"Latin <i>discordia</i>: <i>dis-</i> + <i>cor, cordis</i> (heart). Hearts apart.","f":"discorde","t":"« La pomme de discorde »."},
