{"w":"pastoral","p":"adj.","m":"Relating to idealised country life.","e":"Latin <i>pastoralis</i>, from <i>pastor</i> (shepherd).","f":"pastoral, champêtre","t":"Shepherds (pasteurs) in green fields."},
