{"w":"quip","p":"n.","m":"A witty remark.","e":"Perhaps from Latin <i>quippe</i> (indeed, forsooth, used ironically).","f":"bon mot, trait d’esprit","t":"A quick quip = « un bon mot »."},
{"w":"rash","p":"adj.","m":"Acting without careful thought.","e":"Middle English <i>rasch</i> (quick), Germanic.","f":"irréfléchi, téméraire","t":"Rushing into it: a rash decision."},
